<title>JAPAN: Showa Yokkaichi Sekiyu 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>Showa Yokkaichi Sekiyu 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Showa Yokkaichi Sekiyu Co Ltd said on Friday that its schedule for maintenance closures of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 is as follows (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	 CDU		    CAPACITY	    CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Yokkaichi 2		90,000	     none</p>
<p>    Yokkaichi 3	     150,000	     30 days around June</p>
<p>Showa Yokkaichi Sekiyu is 75 percent owned by Showa Shell Sekiyu KK, which is in turn 50 percent held by the Royal Dutch/Shell Group.</p>
</text>
